<title>ESTONIA: RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 7.</title>
<headline>RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 7.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio news report on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Ralpa's new waste water treatment plant will help protect the bird life in Matsalu wildlife reserve.</p>
<p>- Summer town, Parnu, will host the ninth international visual anthropological film festival</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
